 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "AlienBaseAttack(n) creates a base covering [0, n] with n unit segments [i, i + 1], 0 <= i < n. attack(x) destroys the segment [x, x + 1]; coordinates are integers and an attack outside the base, or repeating an earlier attack, changes nothing. isDestroyed() returns true exactly when every unit segment of the base has been destroyed. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
